{"id":"n87258-1-10","stage":5,"title":"확충 · 扩充","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87258-1-10-1","ko":"마을의 도로가 좁고 파인 곳이 너무 많아요.","zh":"我们村的道路太窄了，而且坑洼的地方太多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"마을의","meaning":"村子，村庄","explanation":"마을：村子，村庄；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"마을","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61099","senseId":"1","lemma":"마을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도로가","meaning":"道路，公路","explanation":"도로：道路，公路；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"도로","audio":"/audio/60982a61e50d3bea9c66.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47886","senseId":"1","lemma":"도로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좁고","meaning":"窄，狭窄","explanation":"좁다：窄，狭窄；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"좁다","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75801","senseId":"2","lemma":"좁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"파인","meaning":"被挖","explanation":"파이다：被挖；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"파이다","audio":"/audio/9e75e7a9a87e1dc49d30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82433","senseId":"1","lemma":"파이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳이","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많아요.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"16a6e53889b32d5b","term":"마을","zh":"村子，村庄","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3","entryId":"61099","definition":"多户人家聚集生活的地方。","pronunciation":["마을"]},{"id":"60982a61e50d3bea","term":"도로","zh":"道路，公路","audio":"/audio/60982a61e50d3bea9c66.mp3","entryId":"47886","definition":"供人或车通行而建造的路。","pronunciation":["도ː로"]},{"id":"19959a056b2a4242","term":"좁다","zh":"窄，狭窄","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3","entryId":"75801","definition":"路的宽度或物体与物体间的距离较短。","pronunciation":["좁따"]},{"id":"9e75e7a9a87e1dc4","term":"파이다","zh":"被挖","audio":"/audio/9e75e7a9a87e1dc49d30.mp3","entryId":"82433","definition":"洞或坑被刨出来。","pronunciation":["파이다"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f8ca963dcd467aef7bf0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87258-1-10-2","ko":"이번에 확충 공사를 하는 게 어떨까요?","zh":"这次是不是可以考虑进行拓宽工程呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"확충","meaning":"扩充","explanation":"확충：扩充","readings":[{"term":"확충","audio":"/audio/23cc99f5ff3bacbe281c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87258","senseId":"1","lemma":"확충","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공사를","meaning":"工程，施工","explanation":"공사：工程，施工；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공사","audio":"/audio/25e51843741edb403b41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23401","senseId":"1","lemma":"공사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떨까요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"23cc99f5ff3bacbe","term":"확충","zh":"扩充","audio":"/audio/23cc99f5ff3bacbe281c.mp3","entryId":"87258","definition":"扩大规模，补充不足。","pronunciation":["확충"]},{"id":"25e51843741edb40","term":"공사","zh":"工程，施工","audio":"/audio/25e51843741edb403b41.mp3","entryId":"23401","definition":"重新建造或改造设施或建筑物。","pronunciation":["공사"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/8b2007132c89c4567894.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.514,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87258","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":169,"sequenceScore":3.3407,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们村的道路太窄了，而且坑洼的地方太多了。","这次是不是可以考虑进行拓宽工程呢？","敏俊啊，你昨天为什么喝那么多酒啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我们村的道路太窄了，而且坑洼的地方太多了。","这次是不是可以考虑进行拓宽工程呢？","敏俊啊，你昨天为什么喝那么多酒啊？"],"answer":1}]}
